1. Project Title
Customer Shopping Behavior Analysis Dashboard

2. Project Overview
This project focuses on analyzing customer shopping patterns and trends using a retail dataset.

The goal is to provide actionable insights into customer preferences and purchasing behavior.

3. Key Features
Interactive Dashboard: Created using Power BI to visualize key metrics.

Data Analysis: Includes data cleaning and exploratory data analysis (EDA) to understand shopping trends.

Visualizations: Uses various charts and graphs to represent customer segments and behavior.

4. Tech Stack
Tool: Power BI Desktop

Data Source: US Retail Dataset (K-Means clustering was also applied for segmentation in related work).

5. How to Use
You can download the Power BI file By Anil.pbix file from this repository and open it in Power BI Desktop to explore the interactive reports.

